-- ---------------------------------------------------------------
-- SUPPLIERS (20 distinct suppliers from the source report;
-- only the name is known from the source - other contact fields
-- are left NULL)
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------
-- MEDICINES (222 distinct medicine names from the source
-- report; code is a sequential MED-NNNN assigned in the order
-- medicines first appear in the source report. Where a name
-- appears multiple times in the source (multiple batches), the
-- manufacturer/category/uom are taken from its first occurrence.
-- generic_name and hsn_code are not present in the source and
-- are left NULL; tax_percent is 0 (no tax data in source);
-- reorder_level defaults to 10 for every medicine.
